Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.33,0:00:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.85,0:00:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.47,0:00:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.65,0:00:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.75,0:01:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.59,0:01:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, quit pressuring me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.83,0:01:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.23,0:01:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Joey's got a monster in\Nhis corner with 3,000 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.57,0:01:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So if he attacks Maric\Ndirectly, he'll win the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.81,0:01:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that easy, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.89,0:01:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, Maric gave that monster to\NJoey, which can mean only one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.47,0:01:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Maric wants Joey to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.27,0:01:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all part of his\Nstrategy to eliminate Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.69,0:01:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let Maric win and\Nadvance to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.65,0:01:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll never rescue\NMai from the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.65,0:01:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I'll be trapped\Nright there with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.73,0:01:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, show me the...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.65,0:01:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.41,0:01:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.77,0:01:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't attack Merrick with Lava Golem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.41,0:01:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that's exactly\Nwhat he wants me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.77,0:01:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why else would that freak give\Nme such a powerful monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.57,0:01:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Lava Golem belongs to you, little Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.95,0:01:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider it a gift with\None small drawback.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.39,0:02:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,With each turn, you lose 700 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.69,0:02:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just let this thing\Nmelt away my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.51,0:02:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I hold on to it, that's\Nexactly what it's gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.99,0:02:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So I better take my chances and\Nuse it against Marek. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.67,0:02:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's only fair to\Nuse the gift you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.29,0:02:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.31,0:02:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say, that's the most intelligent\Nthing you've said this entire duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.49,0:02:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.43,0:02:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you finally came to your senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.27,0:02:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Or, perhaps you realize the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There's absolutely no way\Nyou can win this. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.07,0:02:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Every pathway leads to\Nthe Shadow Realm. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.75,0:02:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to a single twisted\Nword that creep says, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.35,0:02:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to psych you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.45,0:02:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler's in quite a predicament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.33,0:02:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If he attacks, Merrick will strike back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.77,0:02:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But if he doesn't, he'll lose life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.45,0:02:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.63,0:02:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,For once, you and I are\Nin agreement, little Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.71,0:02:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment you attack me,\Nit's all over for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.79,0:02:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I guess I'll have to take my chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.33,0:03:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.24,0:03:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.27,0:03:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.03,0:03:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't watch, is it over yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.35,0:03:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to block your attack with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.77,0:03:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal Tramp!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.13,0:03:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This card, known as Relieve Monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.91,0:03:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,allows me to return one\Nof my monsters to my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.23,0:03:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Once that happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.69,0:03:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can replace that creature with any\Nfour-star monster I'm holding in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Really swift move, Einstein,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.51,0:03:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,because you don't have any monsters\Nto return to your hand. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.63,0:03:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're forgetting about the Plasma Eel\Nattached to Joey's Panther Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.85,0:03:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Plasma Eel, return to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.49,0:03:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And since it's a four-star monster,\NI can bring it back in defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you remember my Plasma\NEel's special ability, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be destroyed in battle. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.87,0:04:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So, your monsters, on the\Nother hand, are not so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.67,0:04:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go, help-o-emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.49,0:04:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to a random\Ncard from your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.21,0:04:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you done? Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.89,0:04:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.21,0:04:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That lava golem of yours\Nis beginning to melt now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.77,0:04:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Costing you 700 life points
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.83,0:04:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.29,0:04:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek's dark side has\Nbeckoned the shadows again
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.97,0:04:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear this madness won't end For\Nwith every soul he feeds to the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.81,0:04:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,shadows The evil within my brother\Ngrows stronger Get ready My move
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.03,0:04:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Machine Duplication?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.45,0:04:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This is exactly the card I\Nneeded to finish this pool off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.31,0:04:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still ahead of this jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.61,0:05:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend's life points may be\Ngreater than mine for the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but that won't last long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.77,0:05:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you figure?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.93,0:05:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Machine Duplication!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.33,0:05:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn one heel into three!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.11,0:05:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.03,0:05:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he can lower the attack\Npoints of more on my monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.59,0:05:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're beginning to catch on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.39,0:05:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Plasma Eels!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.25,0:05:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Drain his monsters of points!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.63,0:05:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And his body of strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.79,0:05:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.53,0:05:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember the rules, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.99,0:05:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,When your monsters are\Ndamaged, you lose energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.57,0:05:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And before long you'll be too\Nweak to move, let alone duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.93,0:05:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you got, Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.45,0:05:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, this is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.13,0:05:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna take more than that to\Nkeep me down, you frizzy-haired freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.13,0:05:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I shall place one card face down\Nand let you go, if you can stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.39,0:06:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Things aren't looking so\Ngood for Joey up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.55,0:06:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.67,0:06:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick's shadow duel is\Nreally wearing Joey down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.43,0:06:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And if he loses, he goes\Nstraight to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.39,0:06:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.43,0:06:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, don't lose hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.81,0:06:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta put out this flaming monster of\Nmine before I lose any more life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.23,0:06:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But I only have one card in my\Nhand, and it can't help me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.41,0:06:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't do something soon, Marek's\Ngonna win and advance to the final round.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.25,0:06:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means the whole world's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.59,0:06:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And I promised Yugi I\Nwouldn't let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.61,0:06:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think I'm gonna let you win this,\Nthen you're even dumber than you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.03,0:06:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, feast your crazy eyes on this, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.87,0:06:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, heart of the\Ncards, show me some love.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.17,0:06:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.33,0:06:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Guildford the Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.79,0:06:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy can kick some serious Magic butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.47,0:06:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There's just one little problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.33,0:06:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta sacrifice three\Nmonsters to summon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.13,0:06:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to his plasma eels, my\Nmonsters are tied up at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So as long as those eels stick\Naround, I can't sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.13,0:07:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That gives me an idea, but\Nit's gonna take some luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.91,0:07:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I'm not in your shoes,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.21,0:07:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,cause you're in for some\Nhurt thanks to my magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.07,0:07:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Graceful Dice, and\Nit's about to change my luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.43,0:07:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,because I can use it to raise the\Nstrength of any monster I choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.87,0:07:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.78,0:07:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've decided to use my card to increase\Nthe attack points of your Plasma Eel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.19,0:07:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Once that happens, your machine\Nduplication goes buh-bye,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.99,0:07:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and so do your other two eels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.69,0:07:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent dueling strategy, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.97,0:07:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Since your magic card only works on\Nmonsters with 500 attack points or less,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Graceful Dice was just a card I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.87,0:07:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, big bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.39,0:07:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If I get a two or more, you're toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.05,0:07:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,According to my math,\Nsix is higher than two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.91,0:07:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That means your Plasma Eel's points increase\Nnow by six times its original strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.23,0:08:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,which means your Machine Duplication\NMagic Card no longer works on it. Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.63,0:08:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you know what happens next, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.53,0:08:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lava Golem and my Rocket\NWarrior are free from your eels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.39,0:08:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.41,0:08:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,now I can sacrifice all\Nthree of my monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.95,0:08:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,to bring out my ultimate fighting machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.77,0:08:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet Gilbert the Lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.77,0:08:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to my pal, Guilford.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.29,0:08:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He's about to crush any hopes you\Nhad of winning this duel, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.05,0:08:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So how does it feel to be\Nstaring into the face of defeat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.17,0:08:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.09,0:08:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to rock the ultimate comeback, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.31,0:08:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now finish this guy off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.05,0:09:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We knew you could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.61,0:09:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have missed the joke, Chuckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.81,0:09:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me fill you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.39,0:09:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,When you used your magic card on my\NPlasma Eel, you raised its attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.33,0:09:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So thanks to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.65,0:09:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My Plasma Eel is now more powerful\Nthan your Guilford the Lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.85,0:09:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like your strategy backfired,\Ngiving me the advantage, little Joey. Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.23,0:09:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'd be dumb\Nenough to let that happen? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.37,0:09:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks as if Merrick thought wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.37,0:09:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,because the special ability of Guilford\Ndestroys every one of Merrick's monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.25,0:09:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to take him down, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.77,0:09:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.15,0:09:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Guilford, show this wannabe what\Nyour special ability is all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.31,0:09:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe out his eel with\Nyour lightning sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.93,0:09:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.15,0:10:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My plasma eel's special\Nability prevents it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.83,0:10:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,from being destroyed in\Nbattle by any monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.37,0:10:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's not paying attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.87,0:10:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me make this easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.79,0:10:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your eel's not the only\None with a special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.93,0:10:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And my Guilford's special ability destroys\Nevery monster you have on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.29,0:10:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you shouldn't have\Nskipped class that day, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.05,0:10:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.63,0:10:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,School's back in session\Nstarting right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.07,0:10:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And Professor Wheeler's in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.57,0:10:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Guilford, teach this kid\Na lesson the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.79,0:10:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack Marek's Life Points directly! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.33,0:10:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better think again. Reveal the\Nface-down card: Nightmare Mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.19,0:10:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Disappointed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Upset because my Nightmare\NMirror blocked your attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.95,0:10:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm afraid it's much worse than that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.51,0:10:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a close look at the\Nterrified image in my mirror
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.07,0:10:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.15,0:11:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The new target of your monster's attack.\NNow feel the wrath of your own creature,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.21,0:11:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Guilford the Lightning
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.85,0:11:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And I escaped without a scratch
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.09,0:11:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You, on the other hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.85,0:11:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are 1,000 light points weaker. And mere\Nsteps away from the Shadow Realm. There's
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.55,0:11:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,only one small price I have to pay and\Nthat's to discard one card to my graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.07,0:11:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is the perfect\Ncard for me to part with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.23,0:11:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,For now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.14,0:11:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,did you honestly think that you could\Ntake control of this duel away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a shadow game, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.83,0:11:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means that I make all the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.85,0:11:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like the sound of this at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.23,0:11:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick must be up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Play that Egyptian god card, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.61,0:11:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.77,0:11:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have any cards\Nin his hand or on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.57,0:12:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So if I can get through this\Nnext turn, I got it made.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.85,0:12:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready? My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.35,0:12:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough with the laughing already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.39,0:12:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Just play a card and let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.59,0:12:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll regret those words, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.01,0:12:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,For I'm about to eliminate you from this\Nduel once and for all with Ra. With Ra?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.57,0:12:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,His Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.41,0:12:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's no way Mera can summon a monster\Nas powerful as the winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.51,0:12:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He has nothing to sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.99,0:12:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, now's your chance to\Nfind out the weaknesses of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.47,0:12:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's working out\Naccording to my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.55,0:12:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Wheeler served as my guinea pig,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.11,0:12:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can watch Ra in action\Nand learn how to defeat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.49,0:12:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I may have been able to read\Nthe Egyptian text on the card,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.71,0:12:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but reading is one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.29,0:12:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,witnessing is another.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.41,0:12:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,When I first saw the ancient writing,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.13,0:12:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that the winged\Ndragon of Ra was powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.41,0:13:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But seeing Marek summon it\Nwas much more useful to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.91,0:13:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, my great beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.27,0:13:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The most powerful of all\Nthe Egyptian god monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.93,0:13:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, like the dragon of Ra, end this duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.99,0:13:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to see Marek's Egyptian God\Ncard one more time. So when I face him
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.51,0:13:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,In the next round I'll be prepared to\Ncrush it. I activate the magic card,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.57,0:13:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster Reborn To bring back Ra
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.45,0:13:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself my great beast of the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.07,0:14:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the last monster\Nyou'll ever see, little Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.73,0:14:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But Merrick's monster\Nhas zero attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.49,0:14:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of strategy is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.01,0:14:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Raw takes on the attack points of the\Nmonsters that are sacrificed to summon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.23,0:14:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But since Merrick didn't make any\Nsacrifices, his monster has no attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.81,0:14:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll activate Ra's ability of\Ninstant attack, so it can attack now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.63,0:14:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's just the\Nbeginning of your troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.41,0:14:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone wanna fill me in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.35,0:14:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Ra is transforming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.35,0:14:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,To hold the true form of Ra!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.31,0:14:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.22,0:14:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.91,0:14:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Because where I'm from, giant\Nflaming birds are not a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.59,0:14:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So give it to me straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.05,0:14:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My winged dragon has taken on\Nthe form of Egyptian god Phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.03,0:14:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,In this mode, Ra is unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.05,0:14:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.11,0:15:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and soon it will belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.19,0:15:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my beast is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.37,0:15:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to feed you to the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.73,0:15:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand not knowing\Nwhat's going on out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.71,0:15:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, Joey's a great duelist,\Nbut Marek can't be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.87,0:15:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at what he did to mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.47,0:15:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi, Ishizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.75,0:15:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, shouldn't you be\Nout there with the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.01,0:15:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I am certain your friends\Ncould use your support.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.89,0:15:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.01,0:15:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, someone needs to stay\Nhere and keep an eye on mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.15,0:15:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since she lost her duel to Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.57,0:15:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.43,0:15:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She hasn't said a word for days. Poor Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.75,0:15:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother's trying to save her mind He\Npromised not to let anything happen to her
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.79,0:16:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's dueling against Maric right\Nnow in a shadow game He thinks winning
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.31,0:16:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,will bring her back So now both of\Nour brothers are facing one another
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.89,0:16:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,in a battle with the ultimate stakes\NI guess that's true And all I can
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.71,0:16:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,do is stay strong for Joey and wish\Nfor the best I'll never give up hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.15,0:16:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I know just how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.73,0:16:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I know there's still good within Merrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.49,0:16:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,and he will be saved\Nfrom the evil inside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.19,0:16:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then all of the wrongs he's\Ncommitted will be fixed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.81,0:16:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and everyone he sent to the\NShadow Realm will return,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.09,0:16:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,including your poor friend Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.53,0:16:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, why don't you go\Nand support your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.85,0:16:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.67,0:16:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep an eye on her for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.49,0:16:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should we both stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.43,0:16:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I promised I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.47,0:16:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.51,0:16:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I promise you\Nshe'll be fine, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.93,0:16:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.11,0:16:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Be there for Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.65,0:17:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Ishizu. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.87,0:17:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong, Serenity. I will. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.21,0:17:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand their bond well,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.71,0:17:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's been so long since I've\Nfelt that bond with my own brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.85,0:17:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And without the power of\Nmy Millennium Necklace,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.73,0:17:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I am unsure what the future holds for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.27,0:17:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.53,0:17:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only hope that destiny\Nhas chosen my brother to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.21,0:17:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,be delivered from the darkness\Nthat now controls him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.09,0:17:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, the whole world\Nis in a great deal of danger
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.33,0:17:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that my beast has taken its\Nstrongest form, victory is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.15,0:17:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it First Merrick summons the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.91,0:17:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,winged dragon of Ra\Nwithout making a sacrifice
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.17,0:17:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So it has zero attack\Npoints Then he transforms
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.39,0:17:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,it into a totally\Ndifferent looking monster
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.37,0:18:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh! Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.09,0:18:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Take heed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,For one of you will have to\Nrealize your darkest nightmare
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and face my winged dragon\Nof raw in the next round.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.63,0:18:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Once little Joey has been\Ndisposed of, that is. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.89,0:18:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Last I checked, this duel\Nwas still on, Psycho Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.49,0:18:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I still got my guilt for\Nthe lightning up at bat,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.33,0:18:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and he's got 2,800 attack\Npoints with your name on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.87,0:18:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, your oversized\Nflame-broiled chicken doesn't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.23,0:18:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You still don't get it, little\NJoey. Like I said, Ra has powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.91,0:18:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,beyond your understanding\Nand unfortunately for you i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.21,0:18:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,about to activate yet another\Nof my creature special abilities
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.69,0:18:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,say what not another one yes\Nin its phoenix mode ra can
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Instantly disintegrate your\Nmonster even though it has zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,attack points all i'm required\Nto do is give up 1000 of my
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.13,0:19:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,life points then raw will be\Nfree to banish you into the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.95,0:19:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,darkness so what if your feathered\Nfriend can use some secret
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.83,0:19:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,ability to wipe out my guilt\Nfit your monster still doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.53,0:19:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,have any attack points which\Nmeans that i'm not gonna lose
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.73,0:19:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,any life points don't you know\Nlosing life points should be
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.61,0:19:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The least of your worries now.\NLook down, thanks to that energy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.09,0:19:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,stream when raw attacks you\Nwill be drained of all your
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.63,0:19:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,strength in a few short moments
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.45,0:19:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,every ounce of energy in your
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.07,0:19:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,body will be gone for good\Nyou'll be rendered completely
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.11,0:19:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,useless at the hands of the\Nwinged dragon of raw the time has
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.15,0:19:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm moments away from claiming my victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.89,0:19:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The phoenix rises tonight!
